  "html": "<lwc-lbc><template shadowrootmode=\"open\"><p class=\"slds-box slds-text-heading_small\" id=\"action\">Action icons represent actions a user can take. The default size of action icons are larger than the others. <br><br><lightning-icon title=\"Approved\"><template shadowrootmode=\"open\"></template></lightning-icon><lightning-icon title=\"Delete\"><template shadowrootmode=\"open\"></template></lightning-icon><lightning-icon title=\"New note\"><template shadowrootmode=\"open\"></template></lightning-icon><lightning-icon title=\"Preview\"><template shadowrootmode=\"open\"></template></lightning-icon></p><p class=\"slds-box slds-text-heading_small\" id=\"doctype\">Doctype icons represent a type of file when a preview or image is unavailable. <br><br><lightning-icon title=\"Audio\"><template shadowrootmode=\"open\"></template></lightning-icon><lightning-icon title=\"Image\"><template shadowrootmode=\"open\"></template></lightning-icon><lightning-icon title=\"MP4\"><template shadowrootmode=\"open\"></template></lightning-icon><lightning-icon title=\"XML\"><template shadowrootmode=\"open\"></template></lightning-icon></p><p class=\"slds-box slds-text-heading_small\" id=\"standard\">Standard icons represent entities and objects within Salesforce. <br><br><lightning-icon title=\"Event\"><template shadowrootmode=\"open\"></template></lightning-icon><lightning-icon title=\"Account\"><template shadowrootmode=\"open\"></template></lightning-icon><lightning-icon title=\"Address\"><template shadowrootmode=\"open\"></template></lightning-icon><lightning-icon title=\"Email\"><template shadowrootmode=\"open\"></template></lightning-icon></p><p class=\"slds-box slds-text-heading_small\" id=\"utility\">Utility icons are used throughout the interface and are SVGs for extensibility. <br><br><lightning-icon title=\"Connected\"><template shadowrootmode=\"open\"></template></lightning-icon><lightning-icon title=\"Warning\"><template shadowrootmode=\"open\"></template></lightning-icon><lightning-icon title=\"Error\"><template shadowrootmode=\"open\"></template></lightning-icon><lightning-icon title=\"Image\"><template shadowrootmode=\"open\"></template></lightning-icon></p><p class=\"slds-box slds-text-heading_small\" id=\"custom\">Custom icons are available in Salesforce to represent user created objects.<br><br><lightning-icon title=\"custom11\"><template shadowrootmode=\"open\"></template></lightning-icon><lightning-icon title=\"custom33\"><template shadowrootmode=\"open\"></template></lightning-icon><lightning-icon title=\"custom51\"><template shadowrootmode=\"open\"></template></lightning-icon><lightning-icon title=\"custom88\"><template shadowrootmode=\"open\"></template></lightning-icon></p></template></lwc-lbc>"
